### ===================================================================
### Webhookvault — HTTP Client Requests Suite
### Padrão RFC 7230 / JetBrains HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client
### Desenvolvido e mantido por: Felipe Madison (@FelipeMadson)
### ===================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@apiKey = test-staff-engineer-token-madison
@contentType = application/json

### 1. Health & Liveness Probe
# Verifica a integridade imediata do serviço, tempo de atividade e status do subsistema WAL.
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
X-Trace-Id: req-trace-1

> {%
client.test("Status code is valid", function() {
    client.assert(response.status >= 200 && response.status < 300, "Response status is not 2xx");
});
client.test("Response is received within latency budget", function() {
    client.assert(response.responseTime < 300, "Latency threshold exceeded");
});
%}

### 2. OpenMetrics / Prometheus Telemetry
# Exporta telemetria em formato texto padrão OpenMetrics para raspagem por Prometheus e Grafana.
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics
Accept: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
X-Trace-Id: req-trace-2

> {%
client.test("Status code is valid", function() {
    client.assert(response.status >= 200 && response.status < 300, "Response status is not 2xx");
});
client.test("Response is received within latency budget", function() {
    client.assert(response.responseTime < 300, "Latency threshold exceeded");
});
%}

### 3. Dispatch / Processar Operação — Webhookvault
# Executa transação com garantia de atomicidade, validação de integridade e registro no log WAL.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/webhookvault/dispatch
Accept: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
X-Trace-Id: req-trace-3
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "action": "PROCESS_TRANSACTION",
  "payload": {
    "clientId": "felipe-madison-tester",
    "timestamp": "2026-09-30T15:18:14.487Z",
    "data": {
      "sampleKey": "enterprise-payload-sample",
      "priority": "HIGH"
    }
  }
}

> {%
client.test("Status code is valid", function() {
    client.assert(response.status >= 200 && response.status < 300, "Response status is not 2xx");
});
client.test("Response is received within latency budget", function() {
    client.assert(response.responseTime < 300, "Latency threshold exceeded");
});
%}

### 4. Consulta de Estado Consolidado — Webhookvault
# Recupera o estado atualizado em memória e estatísticas de processamento persistidas.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/webhookvault/state
Accept: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
X-Trace-Id: req-trace-4

> {%
client.test("Status code is valid", function() {
